stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> DraftGoal
    DraftGoal --> GoalSubmitted: employee submits
    GoalSubmitted --> GoalApproved: assigned manager approves
    GoalSubmitted --> ChangesRequested: manager requests changes
    ChangesRequested --> DraftGoal: employee revises
    GoalApproved --> ProgressTracking
    ProgressTracking --> SelfAssessmentSubmitted: employee submits self-review
    SelfAssessmentSubmitted --> ManagerAssessment: assigned manager reviews
    ManagerAssessment --> ReadyForHR: required ratings complete
    ReadyForHR --> HRFinalized: HR finalizes after validation
    HRFinalized --> ResultsReleased: HR releases results
    ResultsReleased --> [*]
    HRFinalized --> Reopened: authorized reopen with reason
    Reopened --> ManagerAssessment
    note right of HRFinalized
      Score and policy version are stored.
      Changes must be audited.
    end note
    note right of ResultsReleased
      Only released results are visible
      to employees according to policy.
    end note
